#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"With Gradio you can browse, search and of course play radio stations. All "
"this is simple and uncomplicated."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:36
msgid ""
"GTK4 rewrite with discover lists, background playback, session track "
"history, and MPRIS."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:41
msgid ""
"This will probably be the last version of Gradio. It includes updated "
"translations and small improvements."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:46
msgid "Updated translations, minor user interface improvements."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:51
msgid ""
"Some discover design tweaks, improved tags support, improved filter popover, "
"updated translations, improved m3u export."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:56
msgid ""
"The \"Discover\" section is back! Merged \"Add\" and \"Search\" page. New "
"unified library view. Library can now be exported as M3U playlist. And much "
"more..!"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"Group your stations into collections, Everything is now sortable, Extended "
"search page, Stations can be created and edited, New details sidebar, New "
"selection system."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sfesenko.gradio.appdata.xml.in:66
msgid ""
"New grid/list view, new right click menu, background playback, redesigned "
